[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 784.949, "timestamp": "00:13:04", "text": "不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 787.91, "timestamp": "00:13:07", "text": "品牌帳號。如果是品牌帳號，您將看不到它。如果是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 790.629, "timestamp": "00:13:10", "text": "個人帳號，我在線上嗎？好的。如果是個人帳戶，應該就能看到了。是的。是的。是的。是的。看，看，看。有一個選項會顯示出來。  所以，"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 796.114, "timestamp": "00:13:16", "author": "@Ninja477", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/DgHpXlaDuDSPk2w40fljKZE0ZpWffCKDHKYfP2DNO6YWP5QEr5mBRcLrJDjF8KH0euY0GnYAF6c=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "mine own"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 798.79, "timestamp": "00:13:18", "text": "如果你是的話，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 803.75, "timestamp": "00:13:23", "text": "如果是這樣的話，Roku剛剛贈送了會員資格，謝謝你贈送的Roku會員資格。點擊通知，它會告訴你，你可能會成為幸運兒，獲得一個玩笑般的"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 814.65, "timestamp": "00:13:34", "author": "@Roku-rin", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/8LlS_C2IirDMfA5r2V0q5G1kudp8dmG6RQvz_jCAUT3H-esyEgTNPDwrfCXiyX7Undc9UmHNgw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "click on that notification"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 823.67, "timestamp": "00:13:43", "text": "會員資格，可以訪問書籍。點選允許收禮。這樣做就對了。點擊允許贈送禮物，我敢打賭"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 825.59, "timestamp": "00:13:45", "text": "你就能收到。如果我點擊"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 827.59, "timestamp": "00:13:47", "text": "個人帳戶的更多選項，只會顯示「封鎖」或「檢舉」。哦，不。但你不能允許這種情況發生。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 833.638, "timestamp": "00:13:53", "author": "@Ninja477", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/DgHpXlaDuDSPk2w40fljKZE0ZpWffCKDHKYfP2DNO6YWP5QEr5mBRcLrJDjF8KH0euY0GnYAF6c=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "it just says block or report"}]